abstract: >-
  Deployment of an INT8 quantized ANN (approximately equivalent to a
  T=1 SNN) for network intrusion detection on the STM32N6570-DK,
  evaluated across four datasets (NSL-KDD, UNSW-NB15, CICIDS2017,
  IoT-23) with multi-seed runs (5-20 seeds), paired Wilcoxon
  signed-rank tests and Holm-Bonferroni correction. INT8 NPU
  inference runs in 0.29-0.46 ms (2.7-4.2x faster than Cortex-M55
  CPU) with estimated energy of 44-69 microjoules per inference and
  Flash of 105-138 KB.
